<#f0f000>:Shadow Sumou - Command List:</>

<#f0f000>:System / Universal:</>
Forward Dash	_F_F / ^3P
Back Dash	_B_B / _B_+^3P
Super Jump	_D_U / ^3K
Advancing Guard <#bebebe>(while guarding)</>	^3P
Recovery <#bebebe>(while being knocked away)</>	_B_DB_D_+^P
Aerial Rave Launcher	^HP / ^LP+^LK
Special Partner <#bebebe>(uses partner stock)</>	^MP+^MK
Variable Attack	^HP+^HK
Variable Counter <#bebebe>(while guarding)</>	_B_DB_D_+^HP+^HK
Variable Combination <#bebebe>(2000)</>	_D_DF_F_+^HP+^HK

<#f0f000>:Shadow Mode <#bebebe>(palettes 1-6)</>:</>
Sumo Press <#bebebe>(Air)</>	_D_+^MK
Tawara Throw <#bebebe>(close)</>	_CLOSE[_B/_F]_+^HP
Force Out <#bebebe>(close)</>	_CLOSE[_B/_F]_+^HK
Sumo Breaker <#bebebe>(Air / close)</>	_AIR_CLOSE[_B/_F]_+^HP
Salt Bomb <#bebebe>(direction changes distance)</>	^S / ^LK+^MP
Infinity Palm	^P_MASH
Sumo Crash Alpha	_D_DF_F_+^P
Sumo Crash Beta	_F_D_DF_+^P
Sumo Crash Gamma <#bebebe>(Air)</>	_D_DF_F_+^P
Crash Direction Change <#bebebe>(during Sumo Crash)</>	_DIRECTION_+^P
Call Back <#bebebe>(close)</>	_F_D_B_+^P
Sumo Force <#bebebe>(hold HK to extend heavy version)</>	_D_DF_F_+^K

<#f0f000>:Shadow Hyper Combos:</>
Neo Sumo Crash <#bebebe>(1000 / Air OK)</>	_D_DF_F_+^2P
Sumo Cannon <#bebebe>(1000)</>	_D_DF_F_+^2K
Dragon Slayer <#bebebe>(1000 / close)</>	_F_D_B_+^2P
Senshuuraku <#bebebe>(3000)</>	_F_D_B_+^2K

<#f0f000>:Oil Mode <#bebebe>(palettes 7-12)</>:</>
Shiko Side	_F_+^MK
Howling Kick	_F_+^HK
Sumo Chop	_F_+^HP
Oil Throw <#bebebe>(close)</>	_CLOSE[_B/_F]_+^HP
Oil Reverse <#bebebe>(close)</>	_CLOSE[_B/_F]_+^HK
Oil Stamp <#bebebe>(Air / close)</>	_AIR_CLOSE[_B/_F]_+^HP
Oil Shower <#bebebe>(stacks up to 30 seconds)</>	_F_D_DF_+^K
Oil Rocket <#bebebe>(close)</>	_F_D_B_+^P
Oil Dive <#bebebe>(hold / Air OK)</>	_F_D_B_+^K
Oil Sliding	_D_DF_F_+^P
Hip Press <#bebebe>(during Oil Sliding / before hit)</>	^P
Quick Oil Shower <#bebebe>(during Oil Sliding)</>	^K

<#f0f000>:Oil Hyper Combos:</>
Flying Oil Spin <#bebebe>(1000 / hold)</>	_F_D_B_+^2K
Oil Coaster <#bebebe>(1000 / close)</>	_F_D_B_+^2P
Oil Combination Hold <#bebebe>(1000)</>	_D_DF_F_+^2K
Oil Rage <#bebebe>(1000)</>	_D_DF_F_+^2P

_!P = Any Punch   K = Any Kick   2P/2K = Any 2 Punches/Kicks
_!3P = All 3 Punches   3K = All 3 Kicks   S = Start
